      "decision_index": 47,
      "player": "GptOSS Sport",
      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Ob Nixilis's Cruelty is premium removal (-5/-5 + exile) being spent on either a 2/1 Mire Triton or a 1/3 Disciple of Perdition - both low-value targets. The opponent's graveyard already has Morkrut Banshee, suggesting bigger threats are coming. Meanwhile, GptOSS Sport has Syr Konrad (3BB) and Ossuary Rats (5B) in hand that need ramping into.",
