      "description": "Casting Termination Facilitator instead of Scale the Heights misses significant value. Scale the Heights would draw a card, gain 2 life, put a +1/+1 counter on Servant of the Scale, and grant an additional land drop — allowing the Swamp to be played this turn too, getting closer to casting the powerful Syr Konrad (3BB) next turn. The Facilitator is a modest tempo play that doesn't advance the primary game plan.",
