      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Using Tragic Slip (a powerful Morbid-enabled removal spell that can give -13/-13) to kill a mere 1/1 Servant of the Scale. Tragic Slip with Morbid active is one of the best removal spells available and could handle much larger threats later. The 1/1 Servant is not threatening - Disciple of Perdition can block it easily, and Opus Tinker could attack with Gravedigger regardless.",
