      "type": "blunder",
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Passed the turn with 6 untapped lands and two castable creatures in hand (Morkrut Banshee at 3BB and Reaper from the Abyss at 3BBB), while opponent has an unanswered Syr Konrad, the Grim on the battlefield. Reaper from the Abyss is a 6/6 flyer that could answer Syr Konrad via its morbid end-step trigger. Passing wastes the entire turn's mana development and leaves a critical threat unchecked.",
